# ASHFALL PROJECT RULES (Cursor)

- Game Engine: Godot Engine 4.7+ (.NET / C# Edition).
- STRICT RULE: NEVER run, launch, or invoke Unity (editor, batchmode, or playmode) for this game unless explicitly suggested/requested by the user!
- All execution, compilation, and testing must be performed with Godot and dotnet (`dotnet build Ashfall.csproj`, `dotnet test`, `godot --path .` / `godot --headless`).
- C# scripts are located in `src/` and `scripts/`.
- Entry scene: `scenes/Main.tscn`.
- Project configuration: `project.godot`.
